faq:
  - q: How do partners log in?
    a: Partners have their own portal login, separate from your staff system. They sign up, verify their email and are approved by your team before they can submit leads.
  - q: What can a partner see?
    a: Their own leads, the status you show for each, remarks, and their commission status and history. They cannot see your other enquiries or customers.
  - q: How is commission handled?
    a: Your team records the commission amount and moves it through pending, approved and paid, with a reference and a history of every change. The partner sees the result.
  - q: Can two partners submit the same customer?
    a: A partner lead is stopped at conversion if an active enquiry already exists on that phone number, and the lead is marked as a duplicate for your team to review.
  - q: Can partners use our own domain?
    a: Yes. The portal can be set up on a custom domain with DNS verification.
